.Dd September 10, 2021
.Dt SNDFILE-PLAY 1
.Os
.Sh "نام (NAME)"
.Nm sndfile-play
.Nd play a sound file
.Sh "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.Nm sndfile-play
.Ar
.Sh "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.Nm
plays one or more sound files on various operating systems using standard audio
output APIs. The following table summarizes which audio API is used where:
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width MacOSX10XXX -compact
.It Linux
ALSA or OSS
.It OpenBSD
sndio
.It FreeBSD
/dev/dsp (OSS)
.It NetBSD
/dev/audio
.It Solaris
/dev/audio
.It MacOSX 10.6
CoreAudio
.It MacOSX 10.7
AudioToolbox
.It Win32
waveOut
.El
.Sh "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.Lk http://libsndfile.github.io/libsndfile/
.Sh "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.An Erik de Castro Lopo Aq Mt erikd@mega-nerd.com
